          },
        },
        {
          '@type': 'Question',
          name: fr('What SUP size is best for yoga?', 'Quelle taille de paddle pour le yoga ?'),
          acceptedAnswer: {
            '@type': 'Answer',
            text: fr(
              'The best yoga SUP is 10 to 11 feet long and 33 to 36 inches wide. Extra width provides the stability needed for standing poses and smooth transitions between postures.',
