            ),
          },
        },
        {
          '@type': 'Question',
          name: fr(
            'Do you manufacture yoga SUPs for private label?',
            'Fabriquez-vous des paddles de yoga en marque blanche ?'
          ),
          acceptedAnswer: {
            '@type': 'Answer',
            text: fr(
              'Yes. Afarer offers OEM/ODM manufacturing for SUP yoga boards with custom deck pad colors, graphics, and packaging for yoga brands, studios, and resort wellness programs worldwide.',
